---
import SeatingLayout from '../layouts/SeatingLayout.astro';
import '../styles/seating.css';
---

<SeatingLayout
  title="座位安排"
  description="匯入班級名單、隨機安排座位，並列印座位名條。"
>
  <div class="seating-shell">
    <section class="seating-panel roster-panel" aria-labelledby="roster-title">
      <div class="seating-panel-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">01 / ROSTER</p>
          <h2 id="roster-title">班級名單</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="roster-count" id="roster-count">尚未載入</span>
      </div>

      <div id="roster-locked" class="roster-locked">
        <p>名單存在 Cloudflare 後台。登入後才能匯入 CSV、查看姓名與安排座位。</p>
        <button class="board-button board-button--dark" id="roster-login" type="button">管理者登入 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      </div>

      <div id="roster-content" class="is-hidden">
        <div class="roster-import-row">
          <label class="file-picker" for="roster-file">選擇 CSV 檔<input id="roster-file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv,text/tab-separated-values" /></label>
          <a class="text-button" href="/seating-roster-template.csv" download>下載 CSV 範本</a>
        </div>
        <p class="csv-format"><strong>標準格式：</strong><code>座號,姓名</code><br />也可匯入含「班級、座號、學號、姓名」欄位的表格；系統只保留座號與姓名，其他欄位會在瀏覽器端丟棄。支援 UTF-8 與 Big5 CSV。</p>
        <div id="csv-preview" class="csv-preview is-hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="roster-actions">
          <button class="board-button board-button--primary" id="import-roster" type="button" disabled>匯入並取代名單</button>
          <button class="text-button" id="roster-logout" type="button">登出</button>
          <span id="roster-message" class="inline-message" role="status"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="roster-table-wrap">
          <table class="roster-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">座號</th><th scope="col">姓名</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="roster-list"><tr><td colspan="2">登入後載入名單</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seating-panel planner-panel" aria-labelledby="planner-title">
      <div class="seating-panel-heading planner-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">02 / ARRANGEMENT</p>
          <h2 id="planner-title">座位表</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="arrangement-count" id="arrangement-count">0 / 36 位</span>
      </div>

      <div class="planner-toolbar">
        <form id="layout-form" class="layout-form">
          <label>排數<input id="row-count" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="6" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
          <span class="dimension-times" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
          <label>每排座位<input id="column-count" type="number" min="1" max="12" value="6" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
          <button class="board-button board-button--quiet" type="submit">更新尺寸</button>
        </form>
        <div class="layout-presets" aria-label="常用座位表尺寸">
          <button type="button" data-layout="6x6">6 × 6</button>
          <button type="button" data-layout="5x7">5 × 7</button>
          <button type="button" data-layout="8x8">8 × 8</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="planner-actions">
        <button class="board-button board-button--dark" id="randomize-seats" type="button" disabled>隨機安排 <span aria-hidden="true">⤨</span></button>
        <button class="board-button board-button--quiet" id="clear-seats" type="button">清空座位</button>
        <button class="board-button board-button--quiet" id="print-chart" type="button" disabled>完成並列印座位表 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        <button class="board-button board-button--primary" id="get-labels" type="button" disabled>取得名條 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="assignment-note" id="assignment-note" role="status">先登入並匯入名單，再點選座位指定座號。</p>

      <div class="seat-map-editor-layout">
        <div class="seat-map-column">
          <div class="stage-marker"><span>FRONT / 前方</span><strong>講台</strong></div>
          <div class="seat-grid-viewport" aria-label="座位表，可左右滑動查看">
            <div class="seat-grid seat-grid--cols-6" id="seat-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="seat-editor" id="seat-editor" aria-labelledby="seat-editor-title">
          <div class="seat-editor-heading">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">ADJUST / SWAP</p><h3 id="seat-editor-title">調整座位</h3></div>
            <span id="selected-seat-label">尚未選擇座位</span>
          </div>
          <p id="seat-editor-hint" class="seat-editor-hint">點選座位後，可直接輸入座號，或指定為無人座位。</p>
          <div id="seat-editor-fields" class="seat-editor-fields is-hidden">
            <label for="seat-student-number">輸入座號</label>
            <input id="seat-student-number" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" enterkeyhint="done" maxlength="3" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="seat-student-name" disabled />
            <p id="seat-student-name" class="seat-student-name">輸入座號後，姓名會自動帶入。</p>
            <div class="seat-editor-actions">
              <button class="board-button board-button--quiet" id="mark-seat-unoccupied" type="button" disabled>指定無人座位</button>
              <button class="text-button text-button--danger" id="clear-seat" type="button" disabled>清除此座位設定</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <p class="privacy-note"><span aria-hidden="true">⌑</span> 座位安排只保存在目前瀏覽器。名條由伺服器驗證管理密碼後產生，不留存列印內容。</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <dialog id="password-dialog" class="password-dialog" aria-labelledby="password-title">
    <form id="password-form">
      <p class="eyebrow">PASSWORD / VERIFY</p>
      <h2 id="password-title">管理者登入</h2>
      <p id="password-description">輸入管理密碼以載入受保護的班級名單。</p>
      <label for="password-input">管理密碼</label>
      <input id="password-input" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="256" required />
      <p id="password-message" class="inline-message" role="status"></p>
      <div class="dialog-actions">
        <button class="board-button board-button--quiet" id="cancel-password" type="button">取消</button>
        <button class="board-button board-button--primary" type="submit">驗證密碼 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <script src="/seating.js?v=20261027-standalone-1" is:inline></script>
</SeatingLayout>
